# Real groups submit via PR into players/player_<k>/ on main, matching how
# previous years' simulators did it (see CONTRIBUTING.md) - those folders are
# committed, not gitignored. Only these three are excluded: they are the TA's
# own local demo/test strategies ("Keep", "Cull", the one that crashes every
# turn), not real submissions, and were never meant to be pushed.
#
# Once real group numbers are assigned, rename or remove these if a real
# group ends up using the same number - `git pull` will refuse to overwrite
# an untracked local file at the same path rather than silently clobbering
# it, so the failure mode is a blocked pull, not lost work, but it is still
# worth clearing out of the way ahead of time.
players/player_1/
players/player_2/
players/player_3/

# Sweep output. Regenerate with `uv run sweep.py configs/<name>.json`; the
# configs are committed, the results are not.
results/

# Per-run debug logs from main.py. Regenerated every invocation.
logs/

# TA notes. Students get README.md; these stay local.
GUIDE.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Tooling
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage

# macOS
.DS_Store
